From: Nikhil Gurram <nikhgurr@qti.qualcomm.com>
Subject: [PATCH] pwhm: hand over MBSSID transmitters before MLO link removal

Read the live MBSSID group and promote an enabled, verified replacement
before removing a transmitter used by other profiles. Confirm group
membership and link recovery before proceeding with graceful removal.
Allow a sole profile on a band to leave without stopping its other MLD
links. Prepare dependencies on every affected band before anchor migration.
Bound preflight retries so a failed handover does not block later commits.

Signed-off-by: Nikhil Gurram <nikhgurr@qti.qualcomm.com>

